{
  "schema": "x64base.site-freshness-contracts.v1",
  "contracts": [
    {
      "id": "command-reference-current-snapshot",
      "authority": "public/artifacts/documentation-progress-v1.json",
      "target": "content/docs/dottalk/command-reference.mdx",
      "mustContain": [
        "## Current full-stack snapshot -- local, not deployed ({as_of_date})",
        "| Website command keys / parsed contracts | {current_vertical.website_command_keys} / {current_vertical.website_command_rows_parsed} |",
        "| Fallback command rows | {current_vertical.website_command_fallback_rows} |",
        "| HELP commands / reachable topics | {current_vertical.help_commands} / {current_vertical.help_reachable_topics} |",
        "| HELP lines | {current_vertical.help_lines:comma} |",
        "| Manual candidate | `{current_vertical.manual_candidate_run}` |",
        "publication gate {current_vertical.first_open_entry} open."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "news-current-status",
      "authority": "public/artifacts/documentation-progress-v1.json",
      "target": "content/news/milestones.json",
      "mustContain": [
        "\"date\": \"{as_of_date}\"",
        "\"title\": \"The documentation stack reaches its owner gate\"",
        "239 command keys matched to 239 parsed contracts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "news-current-status-first",
      "authority": "public/artifacts/documentation-progress-v1.json",
      "target": "app/news/page.tsx",
      "mustContain": [
        "WorkingLog limit="
      ],
      "mustAppearBefore": [
        ["WorkingLog limit=", ">Latest announcements</h2>"]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "current-work-freshness-disclosure",
      "authority": "public/artifacts/documentation-progress-v1.json",
      "target": "content/docs/labtalk/current-work.mdx",
      "mustContain": [
        "Freshness disposition: `{current_vertical.current_work_feed_state}`",
        "through {as_of_date}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-sync-snapshot-disclosure",
      "authority": "public/artifacts/documentation-progress-v1.json",
      "target": "content/docs/labtalk/agent-sync.mdx",
      "mustContain": [
        "title: \"AI Agent Sync -- Reconciled Snapshot\"",
        "**Reconciled snapshot: 2026-08-15a -- not a live feed.**",
        "status is reconciled through {as_of_date}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "downloads-staged-manual-snapshot",
      "authority": "public/downloads/current/DEVELOPER_MANUAL_LATEST.json",
      "target": "app/downloads/page.tsx",
      "mustContain": [
        "Latest staged assembled-manual snapshot",
        "<strong> {generated_on}</strong>: {counts.parts} parts, {counts.command_pages_bound} bound command pages, and {total_lines:comma} lines.",
        "A stable address is not an automatic freshness claim."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "developer-manual-staged-snapshot",
      "authority": "public/downloads/current/DEVELOPER_MANUAL_LATEST.json",
      "target": "content/docs/dev/developer-manual.mdx",
      "mustContain": [
        "**Staged snapshot:** generated {generated_on}; {counts.parts} parts, {counts.command_pages_bound} bound command pages,",
        "and {total_lines:comma} lines."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-reconciliation-check",
      "authority": "public/artifacts/documentation-progress-v1.json",
      "target": "content/docs/getting-started/faq.mdx",
      "mustContain": [
        "**FAQ reviewed {as_of_date}.**",
        "### What is MINIDB -- is it only metadata about another database?",
        "It is an **Alpha implementation lane**",
        "## Local Preview And Contributor Surfaces"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-portal-normalized-hierarchy",
      "authority": "public/artifacts/documentation-progress-v1.json",
      "target": "content/docs/labtalk/ai-portal.mdx",
      "mustContain": [
        "## Professional Identifier Model",
        "| `AIF-NNN` | Governed intake or work lane |",
        "| `R<n>` | Global doctrine or owner ruling |",
        "reported as a compatibility seam. New records keep run and report identities",
        "[AI Portal schema reference](/docs/labtalk/ai-portal-schemas)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-portal-development-overview",
      "authority": "public/artifacts/documentation-progress-v1.json",
      "target": "content/portal/overview.mdx",
      "mustContain": [
        "title: \"AI Portal -- Professional Architecture\"",
        "## Normalized hierarchy",
        "## Schema and Feed Flow (DFD)",
        "## Professional Process Flow (PFD)",
        "closeout does not imply publication ascent."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-portal-registered-schemas",
      "authority": "public/artifacts/documentation-progress-v1.json",
      "target": "content/docs/labtalk/ai-portal-schemas.mdx",
      "mustContain": [
        "The registered surface contains 19 table schemas across five custody domains.",
        "| Global rulings | `SYSRULING` |",
        "| Portal tracking | `SYSLANE`, `SYSRUN`, `SYSRUNLANE`, `SYSPROOF`, `SYSTASK` |",
        "| `dottalk.portal.identifiers.v1` |",
        "New records keep execution and report identities separate."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-portal-matrix-record",
      "authority": "public/artifacts/documentation-progress-v1.json",
      "target": "content/docs/dev/website-documentation-matrix.mdx",
      "mustContain": [
        "| AI Portal professional model |",
        "19 registered DBF schemas across identity/RBAC, BBS, rulings, tracking, and SelfDoc",
        "normalized AIF/R/run/task/proof/report hierarchy",
        "Local `/portal/*` working references remain excluded and are not public dependencies."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "freshness-sweep-matrix-record",
      "authority": "public/artifacts/documentation-progress-v1.json",
      "target": "content/docs/dev/website-documentation-matrix.mdx",
      "mustContain": [
        "## {as_of_date} Site-Wide Freshness Sweep",
        "| `/news` | `maintained` / generated feed |",
        "| `/docs/labtalk/current-work` | `maintained_current` envelope / generated body |",
        "| `/downloads`, `/docs/dev/developer-manual`, `/docs/dev/manual-assembly` |"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
